    You are the leader of the Flesh Cult. 
            Your objectives and allies are listed in your character menu. 
            Consume flesh creatures to gain new abilities; stay in the shadows and prepare for the arrival of the Flesh upon the station. 
            Ensure that none of your cult members die in vain.
